Opening My Meds crashed on Android once a med had times in two groups: the hub's list is one LazyColumn, which takes a key once, so rows are keyed by group and med

diff --git a/Piru/Views/Journal/DailyDose/MyMedsHubView.swift b/Piru/Views/Journal/DailyDose/MyMedsHubView.swift
index 9b729445..29bc16e7 100644
